        "slc_47c28e40c1c1527693fbc68f1bc4f3e3f587689d7c7550001ded0f40690826ec"
      ],
      "text": "Implemented v1 commands include `vp run`, `vp stop <agent|--all>`, `vp list`, `vp config init/show/path`, and `vp version`."
    },
