      ],
      "text": "`--ikwid` appends each agent's auto-approval/permission-skip flag when supported; e.g. claude gets `--dangerously-skip-permissions`, gemini and qwen get `--approval-mode=yolo`, and several agents (opencode, auggie, tau, jcode, freebuff, dsh) are listed as not supported."
    },
