      "text": "Repository development practice: the test runner is pytest (`python -m pytest`); CI also validates default images with `scripts/check_default_images.py`, and `ruff check`, `ruff format --check`, and `mypy` are pre-commit gated. Tests should run with a throwaway `VP_CONFIG_DIR` when a host global config exists."
